      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a project for my psych class. i need to design some survey questions for a study on behavioral indicators in high-risk urban environments. basically, i need questions that can help identify specific personality traits or behavioral patterns that are more common in those specific demographic groups. can you help me brainstorm some scenarios or questions that would work for that?",
